        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Shannon Purser, John R. Leonetti, Barbara Marshall, Joey King, Ki Hong Lee, Sydney Park, Elisabeth Rohm, Ryan Phillippe, RJ Cyler, Noah Centineo, Will Peltz, Kristine Froseth, Lea Thompson, Alan Ruck\n- Films: Wish Upon, Sierra Burgess Is a Loser\n- Concepts: film debut, Cyrano de Bergerac retelling\n\nFacts:\n- In 2017, Shannon Purser made her film debut as June Acosta in the horror film \"Wish Upon\".\n- In 2017, \"Wish Upon\" was released as an American supernatural horror film directed by John R. Leonetti and written by Barbara Marshall.\n- \"Wish Upon\" stars Joey King, Ki Hong Lee, Sydney Park, Elisabeth Rohm, and Ryan Phillippe.\n- \"Sierra Burgess Is a Loser\" is a modern retelling of the \"Cyrano de Bergerac\" story.\n- \"Sierra Burgess Is a Loser\" stars Shannon Purser, RJ Cyler, Noah Centineo, Will Peltz, Kristine Froseth, Lea Thompson, and Alan Ruck.",
